# ROOF GRIND and the goal Roof Grind a Hybrid: parked cars' roof edges are grind lines (48,590 car edges
# in the city). A roof is 1.47 m above the road, out of reach of an ollie (1.17 m), so a boneless
# (up, up, pop: 20% more) from the street beside a car on Valencia, the grind pressed at the top: BS
# 50-50 along the east roof edge to its end, then down clean in the street. (The car 3 m further
# south since city phase 11, the start with it. In the squeezed city a longer car is parked there,
# its roof 0.2 m longer and starting 0.67 m further north; the start moved with it again.)
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -60.53 -273.04 2.37 -4.6
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x -0.3208
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y 3.9871
hold ollie 145..175
tap up 163
tap up 170
tap grind 219
bot balance
run 480
expect event trickEnd{trick=Boneless} within 174..178
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50,line=car_-62_-266} within 218..222
expect event grindEnd{reason=end} within 289..293
expect event gap{id=roof_grind,gap=ROOF GRIND,points=400} within 289..293
expect event goalComplete{id=roofgrind,name=Roof Grind a Hybrid} within 289..293
expect event land{quality=clean} within 371..375
expect event comboLanded{name=Boneless + BS 50-50 + ROOF GRIND} within 382..386
expect no event bail
